ti-digit integers.\n\nDEPS:\n- FsLexYacc (v11.3.0)\n- FSharp.Text.Lexing\n\nVERSION_CONTROL_STATUS:\n- No git operations recorded in recent events.", "summary_offset": 4, "llm_response_id": "chatcmpl-ffe4dd81-11f2-449d-9228-676eb1234c66", "kind": "Condensation"}
